{
  "uid": "claude-code-usage",
  "title": "Claude Code — Usage & Cost",
  "tags": ["claude-code", "otel"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "Model",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total, model)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Totals (from Prometheus metrics)",
      "id": 100,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cost",
      "id": 1,
      "description": "Sum of each session's cumulative counter. max_over_time is deliberate — see the Notes row at the bottom.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 4, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_cost_usage_USD_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tokens",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sessions",
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_session_count_total[$__range]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active time",
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(claude_code_active_time_seconds_total[$__range]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Tokens by type",
      "id": 5,
      "description": "A high cacheRead share is good — cache reads are much cheaper than fresh input tokens.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false },
        "legend": { "showLegend": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (type) (max_over_time(claude_code_token_usage_tokens_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Cost by model",
      "id": 6,
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 4 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "values": ["value"] },
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (model) (max_over_time(claude_code_cost_usage_USD_total[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Sessions by terminal",
      "id": 7,
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "values": false },
        "legend": { "showLegend": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (terminal_type) (max_over_time(claude_code_session_count_total[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{terminal_type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Over time (from Loki events — exact per-request data)",
      "id": 101,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cost per interval, by model",
      "id": 8,
      "description": "Derived from api_request events, so every request is counted exactly once.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4,
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "auto", "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", event_name=\"api_request\"} | unwrap cost_usd [$__interval]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API latency p50 / p95 (ms)",
      "id": 9,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 0, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "auto" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.95, {service_name=\"claude-code\", event_name=\"api_request\"} | unwrap duration_ms [$__interval]) by (model)",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{model}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "quantile_over_time(0.50, {service_name=\"claude-code\", event_name=\"api_request\"} | unwrap duration_ms [$__interval]) by (model)",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests per interval",
      "id": 10,
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 1, "drawStyle": "bars", "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (count_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", event_name=\"api_request\"}[$__interval]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Output tokens per interval",
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "auto" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=\"claude-code\", event_name=\"api_request\"} | unwrap output_tokens [$__interval]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "output tokens"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Raw events",
      "id": 102,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "API requests — click a line to expand cost, tokens, latency, IDs",
      "id": 12,
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"claude-code\", event_name=\"api_request\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Notes",
      "id": 13,
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Why `max_over_time` and not `increase`?** Each Claude Code session emits its own counter series, which appears *already at its final value* and then expires a few minutes after the session ends. `increase()` treats that first sample as its baseline and reports **0**. Summing each series' max gives the true total.\n\n**Why are the time-series panels on Loki?** Metrics have the same first-sample problem over short windows. The `api_request` events carry exact per-request `cost_usd`, `duration_ms` and token counts, so aggregating those is precise.\n\nFull explanation: <http://localhost:8000/queries/>"
      }
    }
  ]
}
